WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.483 --> 00:00:10.305
Long, long ago, there was a king who was very vain.

2
00:00:11.065 --> 00:00:14.387
He liked to wear only new and beautiful clothes.

3
00:00:15.288 --> 00:00:18.770
He did not care about his soldiers or his servants.

4
00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:21.711
He only cared about his clothes.

5
00:00:23.072 --> 00:00:25.073
Two crooks heard about the vain king.

6
00:00:25.093 --> 00:00:30.656
"Hmm, the king only cares about new and beautiful clothes."

7
00:00:31.548 --> 00:00:33.550
"He is so vain.

8
00:00:34.251 --> 00:00:35.552
Let's trick him!"

9
00:00:35.572 --> 00:00:41.858
"How?" "Let's pretend to sew some new clothes for the king.

10
00:00:42.738 --> 00:00:48.083
We will say that the clothes are invisible only to foolish people."

11
00:00:48.464 --> 00:00:50.325
"What a good idea!

12
00:00:51.106 --> 00:00:57.151
Then nobody can tell the king that there is really no cloth at all."

13
00:01:01.356 --> 00:01:03.638
So the crooks went to meet the king.

14
00:01:04.479 --> 00:01:06.220
They brought a loom with them too.

15
00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:11.004
"Your Majesty, our loom is very special.

16
00:01:11.665 --> 00:01:13.386
It makes beautiful cloth.

17
00:01:14.387 --> 00:01:18.411
Also, the cloth can only be seen by smart people.

18
00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:22.534
Let us make some beautiful clothes for you from this cloth."

19
00:01:22.674 --> 00:01:29.240
"Hmm. Okay, make me some new clothes!"

20
00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:31.761
"Yes, Your Majesty.

21
00:01:32.781 --> 00:01:38.424
But first, give us some golden silk and golden buttons for your new clothes."

22
00:01:40.024 --> 00:01:42.605
Every day the crooks pretended to sew.

23
00:01:43.506 --> 00:01:46.487
So they made loud noises with the loom.

24
00:01:47.888 --> 00:01:53.390
And every day the crooks asked for more golden silk and golden buttons.

25
00:01:54.211 --> 00:01:57.152
But none were used for the king's new clothes.

26
00:01:57.804 --> 00:02:01.106
The crooks kept all of the materials for themselves.

27
00:02:01.126 --> 00:02:07.390
"Go and see how soon my beautiful clothes will be ready."

28
00:02:07.971 --> 00:02:09.131
"Yes, Your Majesty."

29
00:02:11.713 --> 00:02:12.334
"Oh no!

30
00:02:13.014 --> 00:02:14.775
I can't see anything at all!

31
00:02:15.676 --> 00:02:16.616
Am I stupid?

32
00:02:17.337 --> 00:02:18.758
What will I tell the king?

33
00:02:19.758 --> 00:02:21.940
I must lie or lose my job!"

34
00:02:25.764 --> 00:02:28.946
"Oh, what beautiful clothes you are making!"

35
00:02:28.966 --> 00:02:30.067
"Thank you!

36
00:02:30.608 --> 00:02:33.870
Please tell the king that his new clothes are done."

37
00:02:38.533 --> 00:02:41.515
Majesty! Now your clothes are done.

38
00:02:42.256 --> 00:02:44.537
The clothes are very wonderful."

39
00:02:44.557 --> 00:02:48.920
"Good! I will wear them in the parade today.

40
00:02:49.581 --> 00:02:53.824
Then everyone will admire me in my beautiful clothes."

41
00:02:56.244 --> 00:02:58.566
The crooks showed the king the new clothes.

42
00:02:59.206 --> 00:03:02.128
But they only pretended to hold up the new clothes.

43
00:03:03.609 --> 00:03:04.590
"Oh no!

44
00:03:05.571 --> 00:03:07.612
I can't see anything at all!

45
00:03:08.633 --> 00:03:14.977
I must pretend to see these new clothes or everyone will know that I am stupid."

46
00:03:14.997 --> 00:03:19.861
"Ah, how beautiful my new clothes look!"

47
00:03:20.881 --> 00:03:22.262
"Here, Your Majesty.

48
00:03:22.763 --> 00:03:24.464
Let me help you put them on.

49
00:03:25.148 --> 00:03:27.509
I am sure they will fit you perfectly."

50
00:03:30.670 --> 00:03:32.351
Soon the parade began.

51
00:03:33.052 --> 00:03:36.313
The king smiled and began to walk down the street.

52
00:03:37.133 --> 00:03:41.415
Everyone was shocked because the king was wearing only his underwear.

53
00:03:42.416 --> 00:03:45.577
But they pretended to admire the king's new clothes.

54
00:03:46.197 --> 00:03:48.418
They did not want to seem stupid too.

55
00:03:48.438 --> 00:03:52.320
"Oh, how wonderful the king looks!"

56
00:03:52.956 --> 00:03:55.257
"What beautiful new clothes!"

57
00:03:57.418 --> 00:04:02.140
But as the king walked down the street, some children began to laugh.

58
00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:04.201
"Oh! Ha-ha-ha!

59
00:04:04.621 --> 00:04:05.582
Look at the king!

60
00:04:06.162 --> 00:04:08.303
He is only wearing his underwear."

61
00:04:08.323 --> 00:04:12.725
"What a foolish and stupid boy!"

62
00:04:12.745 --> 00:04:15.006
"Oh my!

63
00:04:15.486 --> 00:04:17.827
The king is only wearing his underwear!

64
00:04:20.392 --> 00:04:24.193
Ha-ha-ha!" Soon everyone watching the parade began to whisper.

65
00:04:24.913 --> 00:04:27.434
Their whispering grew louder and louder.

66
00:04:27.454 --> 00:04:31.015
"Oh my!

67
00:04:31.035 --> 00:04:33.136
I have been tricked!

68
00:04:33.696 --> 00:04:37.117
I am so ashamed and stupid!

69
00:04:38.057 --> 00:04:40.118
What should I do now?"

70
00:04:44.399 --> 00:04:46.680
The king wanted to stop the parade.

71
00:04:47.212 --> 00:04:51.596
But it was too late to admit that he was only wearing his underwear.

72
00:04:53.018 --> 00:04:55.040
So the parade continued.

73
00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:58.863
But the embarrassed king's face turned very red.
